= A New Faction: Economic Populists

Rust Belt and rural officials argue that the party has lost touch with the places it once represented. They want a message about jobs, trade, and dignity, with less cultural scolding.

A faction of populists is taking shape.

- @populist_welcome: Give them a platform
- @populist_ignore: Hold the line

@populist_welcome
on-arrival: populist_discovered = 1; populist_strength += 6; populist_dissent -= 5; progressive_dissent += 2; working_dem += 1*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 1*(1-dissent)

Voices from the heartland get a bigger megaphone.

@populist_ignore
on-arrival: populist_discovered = 1; populist_dissent += 6

The populist caucus grows restive.
